    title "While validating a single Structures.pdf page, the documented `lege…"
    state superseded
    statement """
        While validating a single Structures.pdf page, the documented `lege book.pdf 195 2000 ...` form parsed `195` as a target dimension rather than a one-page range and began processing all 632 pages. Single-page range syntax is ambiguous with numeric target syntax; `195-195` is the necessary workaround but the help says `5` is valid.
        """
    observed_at git:5111194256cf31247e1d5157a120595619554520
    author "codex"
    created_at 2026-08-12
}

